{"articleNo":"357895","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=357895&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교내행사] [입학처] 제23기 KIT 학생홍보대사 모집 안내(연장)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2022.03.30","hit":"40012","attachments":[{"name":"제23기 KIT 학생홍보대사 지원 양식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=357895&attachNo=110696"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">제23기 KIT 학생홍보대사 모집 안내(연장)</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">국립 금오공과대학교를 빛낼 2022학년도 새얼굴을 찾습니다.</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><br></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">1. 선발인원:</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>7명이내</b></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2. 지원자격</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2022학년도 신입생</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">으로 용모가 단정하고 애교심이 강한자로 1년이내 휴학하지 아니할 자</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">3. 접수기간: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 24pt;\">~&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 24pt;\">2022년 4월 24일(일)까지</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>4. 제출서류</b>(<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\"><u>붙임파일 참조,&nbsp;</u></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 94, 0);\"><u>아래 3가지 모두 제출</u></span>)</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">- <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">KIT 학생홍보대사 지원서 1부.</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;- <span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">KIT 학생홍보대사 지원동기 및 활동계획서 1부.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">개인정보 수집,이용 동의서 1부.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">5. 제출방법(아래 2가지 방법중 택1)</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가. E-Mail 제출: star@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나. 방문제출: 본관 301호 입학처</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">6. 활동내용 및 혜택</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;가. 활동내용</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 교내·외 행사 지원 업무</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 홍보매체(영상,인쇄물) 제작 및 모델 활동</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 각종행사 의전 활동</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 온라인 홍보매체(Youtube, 네이버블로그, 인스타그램등) 활동</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 입학설명회 및 박람회 참여등</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;나. 활동혜택</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 소정의 봉사장학금 지급</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 학생홍보대사 유니폼 지급(1년차에 한함)</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 국내외 어학연수 추천</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 봉사활동 확인서 발급</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">취업시 총장추천서 발급</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; - 생</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">활관 입사 추천, 학생홍보대사 연수 및 수련회 지원</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">7. 선발방법</span></b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>&nbsp;가. 1차 서류심사: </b>지원자격과 지원서류 제출 적합 여부 심사</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>&nbsp;나. 2차 면접심사</b></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - 서류심사 합격자에 한하여 하단의 평가항목을 기준으로 평가항목별로 점수를 부여하여 합계점수가 높은자 순으로 선발</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">발표력(30점), 인성·태도</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">·용모(20점), 애교심(20점), 인재상(15점), 기초학력평가(15점)</span></span></p><p><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\"><b>8. 서류심사 합격여부 및 면접심사일은 추후 안내</b></span></font></p><p><font face=\"Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.6667px;\">9. 기타 문의사항은 본교 입학처(054)478-7979로 문의 바랍니다.</span></font></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
